      </div>
      <div class="axisline"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>2025/26 season shape, new-form cases by month</h3>
      <p class="sub">January carries 43.6% of the season; weekends carry 51.7%; 15:00 is the peak hour</p>
      <div class="chartwrap">
