  <section class="sec">
    <div class="kicker">Clarity gained</div>
    <h2>Things that are measurable for the first time</h2>
    <p class="note">The old form's date field mirrored the record's creation time, so the gap between treating a patient and documenting the case was structurally invisible. The new form records treatment time independently, exposes workflow state, and replaces a free-text catch-all (narrative present on 96.4 per cent of 2024/25 cases) with structured fields (narrative needed on 15.6 per cent).</p>

