  <section class="sec">
    <div class="kicker">Form performance</div>
    <h2>The branching design answers its own questions</h2>
    <p class="note">When a conditional question set is presented, it is answered. Residual blanks concentrate in the 74 forms still open in the workflow: on completed forms, core categorical blanks run at 1.7 to 2.1 per cent.</p>
