        <p class="sub">Specific-problem question set per nature branch</p>
        <div class="row"><div class="name">Medical</div><div class="track"><div class="bar" style="width:100%" title="138 of 138 answered"></div></div><div class="val">100% <span class="n">n=138</span></div></div>
